CMS-SEC-08.fix:
Add authentication requirements or restrict the location block to trusted internal IPs in the Nginx configuration:
```nginx
  location /mcp {
    allow 127.0.0.1;
    deny all;
    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8080;
  }
```

CMS-SEC-05.fix:
Add `server_tokens off;` to the http or server block in the Nginx configuration:
```nginx
server {
  server_name {{ domain }};
  server_tokens off;
}
```
